# Jake gains life for each landfall trigger; only the second resolution that turn investigates (CR 603.2h, 701.16).
# Jake Sisko, War Correspondent {1}{G}: Legendary Creature — Human Citizen
#   Landfall — Whenever a land you control enters, you gain 1 life. If this is the second time this ability has resolved this turn, investigate. (Create a Clue token. It's an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this token: Draw a card.")
# A Fabled Passage fetches a Forest after entering, so landfall resolves twice this turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Jake Sisko, War Correspondent
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Fabled Passage
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

